xtract_moving_standard_deviation()

\f[ y_m = \sqrt{\frac{1}{w-1} \sum_{n=m}^{m+w-1} (x_n - \bar{x}_m)^2}, \quad \bar{x}_m = \frac{1}{w} \sum_{n=m}^{m+w-1} x_n, \quad m = 0, \ldots, N-w, \quad 2 \le w \le N \text{ the window given in argv} \f]

No published source is listed.

